    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期槽点】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「破产不破防，没钱也能high翻天！」</span></p><span></span><p><span>不再为名牌喘气，而是为省钱欢呼！</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟着我们的脚步，从“原装顶配”到“平替就好”</span></p><span></span><p><span>重新定义消费需求，理性线上线下购物</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起揭秘消费降级的「幸福密码」～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>主播：大鱼/小蚓/大熊/啊pia</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>后期：大鱼</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a></span></strong><span> 年少的攀比有多昂贵，现在就有多后悔</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a></span></strong><span> “天价”餐桌！重新定义“实用主义”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a></span></strong><span> 购物节后在各自的包裹数量上暗暗较劲</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a></span></strong><span> 追忆第一届“双11”购物狂欢节</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a></span></strong><span> 凑单满减永无止尽</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1836">30:36</a></span></strong><span> 拒绝“粉红税”！关键词一换，钱包鼓一半</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a></span></strong><span> 超前消费是座大山</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3087">51:27</a></span></strong><span> 今天背什么包取决于昨天喝什么牌子的奶茶</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a></span></strong><span> “体验派消费”未尝不是一种收获</span></p><span></span><p><span>【小尾巴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请点赞、打赏、评论、订阅我们！在节目收听中如果觉得有需要改进的地方，也欢迎帮我们指出，我们很听劝的，油盐都进！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《Sunday Breakfast》-Anthony Lazaro</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《STRINGS》-MAX/JVK