  <item>
    <title>Vol.08｜在秋天，做chill事！秋日限定大赏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65507888aa96f6e64276c735</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65507888aa96f6e64276c735</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Nov 2023 07:02:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期槽点】</span></p><span></span><p><span>敏感的人通常更容易受到光、声音以及他人不易察觉的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是「秋天」成了高敏人群的高光季节～</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天太短暂了，以至于我们还没来得及细细感受就消失殆尽在香喷喷的烤红薯里、暖呼呼的肉桂拿铁里、黄灿灿的落叶里、肥大宽松的卫衣里......</span></p><span></span><p><span>11月是秋季最后的喘息，今天我们就来和大家来聊聊转瞬即逝的秋天～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>主播：大鱼/小蚓/大熊/啊pia</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>后期：大鱼</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">05:39</a> 秋天是桂花的香气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 秋天是热乎乎的泡面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> 秋天是「好柿发生～」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 只有散步，我们才真正聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2271">37:51</a> 秋天是开启新计划的别样选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a> 秋天是告别也是新生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 人在囧途，终被治愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> 秋天的恋爱也是粉色的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3617">60:17</a> 浪漫过敏，发疯实录</span></p><span></span><p><span>【小尾巴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请点赞、打赏、评论、订阅我们！在节目收听中如果觉得有需要改进的地方，也欢迎帮我们指出，我们很听劝的，油盐都进！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《Weather》-Novo Amor</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《this is what autumn feels like》-JVKE</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJI57VRD0l2bMAcJvRC53NmIKDt.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
