    <title>Vol.07｜勇敢说「不」后，我的导师和领导都......</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65465123e5f242983f8d926d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65465123e5f242983f8d926d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Nov 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>大鱼/大熊/小蚓/啊pia</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【本期槽点】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「勇敢的人先 SAY NO！」</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家都在说勇敢的人先享受世界，可真正的勇者又有几个呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>「不好意思拒绝」「羞于说不」「无法表达真实诉求」......</span></p><span></span><p><span>天知道因为这些我们背负了多少莫须有的精神内耗！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就来和大家聊聊关于「勇敢说不」这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想大声 SAY NO，加入我们，就现在！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Time Line】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 主动挥别错的人，及时止损</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 原来“雪糕刺客”只会背刺薄脸皮的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 理发店内勇敢发声「剪得真丑！」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 为选心仪导师一个人扛下了所有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 领导的嘴，骗人的鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 正面刚没有边界感的同事——爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a> 立一个“硬柿子”的人设很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> 稳定「精神内核」，堵住「内耗缺口」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> 别让愧疚成为表达不满的障碍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2875">47:55</a> 给予自己更多的安全感，勇敢说不！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【小尾巴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目，请点赞、打赏、评论、订阅我们！在节目收听中如果觉得有需要改进的地方，也欢迎帮我们指出，我们很听劝的，油盐都进！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《Sunroof》-Nicky Youre/Dazy</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《Same Sun》-Before You Exit</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJI57VRD0l2bMAcJvRC53NmIKDt.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
